# Lightwheel Enhancements: "Enchant creature or Vehicle" (CR 303.4, 301.7). Bot1 controls a Smuggler's Copter that is no
# creature and two Moxes. The Aura cannot be cast on a Mox Jet, an artifact that is neither (it is refused), but can on the
# Copter, a Vehicle that is not a creature: it gains vigilance beside its printed flying (no power or toughness is shown for a
# noncreature).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Smuggler's Copter
Lightwheel Enhancements
Mountain x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Smuggler's Copter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Types = Artifact
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Lightwheel Enhancements.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet)
Bot1.Hand.Lightwheel Enhancements.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Lightwheel Enhancements.AttachedTo = Smuggler's Copter
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Types = Artifact
Bot1.Battlefield.Smuggler's Copter.Keywords = Flying; Vigilance
